# Vendored EADOS factory and the Claude Code command adapters — TRACKED in this repository by the
# owner's decision (bootstrap PR #1): the slash-command pointers must resolve on every clone and the
# factory version in use must be reviewable. The factory's generated default excluded both
# (`/.eados-core/*` except `learning/runs/`, and the per-host adapter trees); those lines were
# removed at scaffold. Python caches inside the factory stay ignored via `__pycache__/` above.
